---
---
<section class="testimonials-section" id="testimonials" aria-labelledby="testimonials-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="testimonials-head">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">VERIFIED COMMUNITY PROOF · GOOGLE BUSINESS PROFILE</span>
        <h2 id="testimonials-heading" class="section-title">Voices From the Mat. Unfiltered &amp; Earned.</h2>
        <p class="section-lead">
          5.0 ★ rating from verified parents, competitors, and everyday grinders training at 30139 Industrial Pkwy SW in Hayward,&nbsp;CA.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="testimonials-layout">
        <article class="testimonial-feature">
          <div class="testimonial-meta">
              <span class="testimonial-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span>
              <strong>Aijaz Patel</strong>
              <span>Youth Parent · Local Guide (17 reviews)</span>
              <span>Hayward, CA · 1 year ago</span>
            </div>
          <p class="testimonial-feature-text">“They didn’t rush the process—they brought my son in slowly, helped him ease into the sport, and most importantly, made sure he felt safe and seen. … Highly recommend UWC to any parent looking for a place where their child can grow—not just in sport, but in life.”</p>
        </article>

        <div class="testimonial-list">
          <article class="testimonial-item">
            <div class="testimonial-meta">
              <span class="testimonial-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span>
              <strong>David Johnson</strong>
              <span>Adult Combat &amp; MMA · Local Guide (33 reviews)</span>
              <span>East Bay, CA · 8 months ago</span>
            </div>
            <p class="testimonial-text">“The best regardless of age—come here to get better. … Healthy competition, humble egos, and a room full of experienced grapplers and MMA fighters pushing each other daily.”</p>
          </article>
          <article class="testimonial-item">
            <div class="testimonial-meta">
              <span class="testimonial-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span>
              <strong>Ingoo Kwak</strong>
              <span>Visiting Youth Parent · Out-of-State</span>
              <span>Visiting Athlete Parent · 1 year ago</span>
            </div>
            <p class="testimonial-text">“Everyone was welcoming, supportive, and treated him like part of the team from the very start. … To our surprise, he was even invited to join the team for a local tournament, which was an amazing experience.”</p>
          </article>
          <article class="testimonial-item">
            <div class="testimonial-meta">
              <span class="testimonial-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span>
              <strong>Robert Escórcio</strong>
              <span>Local Guide (30 reviews)</span>
              <span>Hayward, CA · Verified Google Review</span>
            </div>
            <p class="testimonial-text">“This club has an amazing and positive vibe. … Whether you are drilling foundations, sharpening scholastic finishes, or training with high-level grapplers, the coaching attention and team culture set UWC apart in the East Bay.”</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonials-actions">
        <a href="https://search.google.com/local/writereview?placeid=ChIJsQd_yMaVj4ARrXw93nb4euo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline">Leave a Google Review ↗</a>
        <a href="/reviews/" class="card-link testimonials-link">Read all reviews &rarr;</a>
        <a href="/reviews/#review-form" class="card-link testimonials-link">Share Your Story &amp; Photos &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

<style>
  .testimonials-section {
    --color-star: var(--color-accent);
    background-color: var(--color-canvas);
    padding: var(--space-section);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-default);
  }

  .testimonials-head {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
  }

  .testimonials-head .section-lead {
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .testimonials-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 6fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 72px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .testimonial-feature .testimonial-meta {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .testimonial-feature-text {
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.6vw, 1.35rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-text-strong);
    margin: 0;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .testimonial-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .testimonial-item {
    padding: 26px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-default);
  }

  .testimonial-item:first-child {
    padding-top: 0;
    border-top: 0;
  }

  .testimonial-item .testimonial-meta {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .testimonials-actions {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-default);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px 28px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .testimonials-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
  }
</style>
